    https://github.com/JetBrains/intellij-community

The following portions are ports/translations (Kotlin/Java -> C#) of files
from that project (see the header comment of each C# file for the exact
original path):

  - src/WinUI.DiffViewer/Core/MyersLcs.cs
      from platform/util/diff/src/com/intellij/util/diff/MyersLCS.kt
  - src/WinUI.DiffViewer/Core/DiffBitSet.cs
      from platform/util/diff/src/com/intellij/util/diff/BitSet.kt
  - src/WinUI.DiffViewer/Core/DiffAlgorithm.cs
      from platform/util/diff/src/com/intellij/util/diff/Diff.kt and
      platform/util/diff/src/com/intellij/diff/comparison/iterables/DiffIterableUtil.kt
  - src/WinUI.DiffViewer/Core/TextUtil.cs
      from platform/util/diff/src/com/intellij/diff/comparison/TrimUtil.kt,
      ComparisonUtil.kt and CharacterUtils.kt
  - src/WinUI.DiffViewer/Core/LineComparator.cs
      from platform/util/diff/src/com/intellij/diff/comparison/ByLineRt.kt
  - src/WinUI.DiffViewer/Core/WordComparator.cs
      from platform/util/diff/src/com/intellij/diff/comparison/ByWordRt.kt
  - src/WinUI.DiffViewer/Core/CharComparator.cs
      from platform/util/diff/src/com/intellij/diff/comparison/ByCharRt.kt
  - src/WinUI.DiffViewer/Core/DiffRange.cs
      from platform/util/diff/src/com/intellij/diff/util/Range.kt
  - src/WinUI.DiffViewer/Core/DiffFragment.cs
      from platform/util/diff/src/com/intellij/diff/fragments/DiffFragment.kt
      and LineFragment.kt

The UI layer (Controls/, Model/, Themes/) is an original work modeled after
the behavior and visual design of IntelliJ's diff viewer
(platform/diff-impl), and after the project structure of WinUI.TableView
(https://github.com/w-ahmad/WinUI.TableView, MIT license — structure only,
no code was copied from it).
